One survivor is found, however, by an American Indian
named Tonto, who nurses him back to health.

5
00:32:23,478 --> 00:32:29,478
The Ranger, donning a mask and riding a white stallion named Silver, teams up with
Tonto to bring the unscrupulous gang and others of that ilk to justice.

